  "formatVersion": "active-reachable-collection-closure.v1",
  "registrySemantics": "Reviewed, fail-closed dispositions for every collection reachable from an active output root. Property membership and the classified occurrence hash are explicit review state, not semantic inference from names. A collection or a new tool/path occurrence requires review before this baseline may change.",
